{"server":"jp","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_02_end","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_02","title":"ステージ続行","storyCode":"OF-2","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"4b94e034ab2211fca4780d3930279050bf6c15a0734b4321aff3d9db0aea4180","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"ビーチに向かって逃げ出したドクターとセイロンの前に現れたのは、セイロンが以前紹介していたシュヴァルツだった。だが、彼女はドクター達と対立する立場にいた。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sunnytown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"セイロン","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"早く！　ドクター！　ビーチの方へ逃げますわよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"セイロン","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"ビーチには多くの観光客がいます。あの中へ紛れれば追いつけないはずですわ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"護衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"止まれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"セイロン","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"貴方たちだけなら――！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"……。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"あれ、君は――","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"セイロン","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"シュヴァルツ！　良かった、やっと会えましたわ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"セイロン","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"貴方がいればなんとかなるわね。クローニンさんはいったいどういうつもりなの！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"セイロン","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター、彼女が前にわたくしが言っていた……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"お嬢様、旦那様が街にいない間は、クローニン様の言うことを聞いてください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"セイロン","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"シュヴァルツ？　何を言っているの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"クローニン様のもとへ戻りましょう。その人たちは彼に任せて。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"シュヴァルツ","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"お嬢様には手を上げたくありませんので。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"セイロン","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"……シュヴァルツ？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["シュヴァルツ"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["セイロン"]}]}
